msgid ""
"Check out this great \"Why Quarkus Finally “Clicks”: The 10 Questions Java "
"Developers Ask Most\" by Markus Eisele as it's a great field guide based on "
"real conversations at conferences, meetups, and across The Main Thread "
"community. Read \"Quarkus Hibernate with Panache Next\" by Stéphane Épardaud "
"to learn about the new Hibernate with Panache extension to unify both "
"Hibernate ORM with Panache and Hibernate Reactive with Panache. Want a "
"complete hands-on tutorial for modern, data-oriented application design? "
"Markus Eisele has you covered with \"Build Event-Sourced Systems in Quarkus "
"with Java Records and CQRS\". Check out Stéphane Philippart's blog post to "
"learn how and why to migrate your Jekyll blog to Quarkus Roq. Read \"Modern "
"Java Meets Native Power: Image Processing with the FFM API in Quarkus\" by "
"Markus Eisele to see how Java 25 integrates with ImageMagick to unlock fast, "
"safe, zero-JNI native workflows. Want a simple way to disable all endpoints "
"in a Quarkus application based on a configuration property? Check out Damir "
"Arh's post \"Disable Quarkus endpoints with a request filter\" for some "
"great instruction."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You will also see the latest Quarkus Insights episodes, top tweets/"
"discussions and upcoming Quarkus attended events."
msgstr ""

